  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Failure is not the problem. You are the problem.",
      "start": 1.55,
      "end": 5.83
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me explain. Hold up a second.",
      "start": 6.55,
      "end": 8.65
    },
    {
      "text": "Because what I mean is that there is a part of you with the hidden power, a strength,",
      "start": 8.99,
      "end": 15.67
    },
    {
      "text": "the ability to craft the kind of life that you've dreamed of, where you have the wealth that you desire,",
      "start": 16.31,
      "end": 23.69
    },
    {
      "text": "the respect from your peers, your partners, and your employees that you've always desired.",
      "start": 24.23,
      "end": 31.11
    },
    {
      "text": "A part of you that realizes that the bad things that happen in life,",
      "start": 31.55,
      "end": 36.73
    },
    {
      "text": "what you might normally think is catastrophic is actually the best thing that could ever possibly happen for you.",
      "start": 37.17,
      "end": 43.95
    },
    {
      "text": "And I call that part the magician, because your power doesn't come from something external.",
      "start": 44.91,
      "end": 51.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Your strength comes internally, meaning that it doesn't come from the wealth.",
      "start": 52.85,
      "end": 59.47
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't come from the relationships.",
      "start": 59.47,
      "end": 61.93
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't come from even the respect or authority that other people will give you,",
      "start": 62.43,
      "end": 67.61
    },
    {
      "text": "but your ability to process those things, to transform them like a magician where somebody else might see",
      "start": 67.89,
      "end": 75.33
    },
    {
      "text": "you going bankrupt or them going bankrupt is catastrophic and terrible.",
      "start": 75.85,
      "end": 80.45
    },
    {
      "text": "But when you utilize the magician within you, you can transform that from being something bad",
      "start": 80.63,
      "end": 86.03
    },
    {
      "text": "into something that happens for you, something that gives you power and empowers you because you were on the right path.",
      "start": 86.03,
      "end": 92.75
    }
  ]
}